"Last-Translator: Automatically extracted <noreply@invalid>\n"
"Language-Team: zh-TW\n"
"Language: zh-TW\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=1; plural=0;\n"

